If you continue facing issues, it might be helpful to check the [official Kotlin documentation](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/whatsnew15.html) or Jetpack Compose release notes for the latest compatibility information. If there's still an error after these checks, please provide additional context, and I'll be happy to assist further.

